1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,930
Something is writing
to me, in neon.

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:03,280
Not me.

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,030
I have beautiful handwriting.

4
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:05,660
I'm Mara.

5
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,090
I fix signs, at night.

6
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:07,800
That's Zip.

7
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:08,950
He complains.

8
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,100
I supervise.

9
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,810
Tonight's job was
left on the step.

10
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:13,360
No name.

11
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,210
No note.

12
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:17,020
Just my mother's mark,
scratched on the back.

13
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,300
Mara, she's been
gone nine years.

14
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,210
I know how long it's been.

15
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:23,160
So I woke it up.

16
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,660
Ooh, it's hello! It's friendly.

17
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:26,380
I love it.

18
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,220
That is not hello.

19
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,080
Help. Zip, pull the plug.

20
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,600
It was never plugged in.

21
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,960
Then it lit one more word.

22
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,080
Tomorrow, what?

23
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,380
Finish your sentence!

24
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:39,690
And outside, a sign I
never made switched on.

25
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,650
It had my name.

26
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:44,490
And someone was
waiting under it.
